Package: libepoll-shim0
Version: @DEB_EPOLLSHIM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jiixyj/epoll-shim
Description: epoll/timerfd/signalfd/eventfd on top of kqueue
 A small implementation of Linux's epoll(7), timerfd, signalfd and eventfd
 APIs on top of kqueue(2), used to build Linux-oriented software (such as
 Wayland) on Darwin/BSD. This package contains the shared library.
